  "summary": "BRYN MAWR, Pa. --(BUSINESS WIRE)--Jul. 29, 2026-- The board of directors of Essential Utilities, Inc. (NYSE: WTRG) today declared a quarterly cash dividend of $0.3606 per share, an increase of 5.25%, payable September 1, 2026, to all shareholders of record on August 11, 2026.",
